participant "Image Analysis Service" as Service
participant "item_categories" as Table <<entity>>

Actor -> Page: 1: Open Analyze item images with Gemini
activate Page
Page -> API: 2: POST /api/posts/analyze-image (multipart)
activate API
API -> API: 3: Validate access session, role and input
alt Valid request
API -> Service: 4: Analyze item images with Gemini
activate Service
Service -> Service: 5: Validate 1-5 images; each <= 10 MB and total <= 14 MB
Service -> Table: 6: Load form catalogue and active leaf category names
activate Table
Table --> Service: 7: Leaf category choices
deactivate Table
alt Catalogue and image input usable
Service -> Service: 8: Call Gemini image analyzer only after explicit user request
Service -> Service: 9: Map suggested category; return draft, confidence and warnings
Service --> API: 10: Editable image-assisted draft
API --> Page: 11: HTTP 200: Editable image-assisted draft
Page --> Actor: 12: Fill draft; review and correct before publishing
else No leaf categories or provider failure
Service --> API: 8.1: Analysis unavailable; retain manual form
API --> Page: 8.2: HTTP 503
Page --> Actor: 8.3: Display error; do not report success
end
deactivate Service
else Invalid input, missing session or insufficient role
API --> Page: 4.1: HTTP 422 / 401 / 403 (429 only if rate-limited)
Page --> Actor: 4.2: Show appropriate error; retain form/draft
end
deactivate API
deactivate Page

